---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ExamHub.pk"
  description="Read our privacy policy to understand how ExamHub.pk collects and protects your data."
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300">Effective Date: October 13, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk ("we," "us," "our," or "the Site") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website, www.examhub.pk.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    
    <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to track user behavior and site traffic. This helps us understand how visitors use our site.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience. These may include analytics cookies and preference cookies.</li>
      <li><strong>IP Address & Device Information:</strong> We automatically receive your IP address, browser type, operating system, and pages visited.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Voluntarily Provided Information</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact Form:</strong> When you submit our contact form, we collect your name, email, subject, and message.</li>
      <li><strong>Email Subscriptions:</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To improve and optimize our website</li>
      <li>To respond to your inquiries and feedback</li>
      <li>To send newsletters and updates (with your consent)</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
      <li>To analyze site usage and trends</li>
      <li>To display relevant content and ads (after Google AdSense approval)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Google Analytics & Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to collect information about how visitors interact with our site. Google Analytics collects data such as:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pages you visit</li>
      <li>Time spent on pages</li>
      <li>Links clicked</li>
      <li>Geographic location</li>
      <li>Device and browser information</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This data is anonymized and used to improve our content and user experience. You can opt-out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies to remember your preferences and improve your experience. You can disable cookies through your browser settings, though this may affect your ability to use certain features of our site.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Subject to Google's Privacy Policy</li>
      <li><strong>Netlify Forms:</strong> Our contact form is powered by Netlify, subject to their Privacy Policy</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense (Future):</strong> Once approved, AdSense will display targeted advertisements and collect data subject to Google's policies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location, you may have rights to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access your personal data</li>
      <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Opt-out of certain data collection</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, please contact us at support@examhub.pk.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by posting the updated policy on this page with a new effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
